-# Product findings: IPM load and history
-
-Findings about InterSystems Package Manager (IPM) at product revision `571e04a1`, from the IPM Verus uplift and its follow-up review. This file replaces the uplift's original `bugs_issues.md`, which stays in git at commit `ae619795`. It reconciles every finding ID the uplift produced (A2 observations, defects, issues, model counterexamples, native cases, reviews, A1 conflicts) with the follow-up's new evidence, one entry per underlying cause. It was revised after an independent review of the owner files (`.g5/uplift/ipm-quality-followup/review/review-owner-files.md`).
