-
-- Q-01 to Q-23 are the ontology's Q blocks. Q-24 to Q-31 are new questions from the follow-up. All of them are researched in `open_questions.md` next to this file, with their options and the authority for each.
-- Option letters in this file are those of `open_questions.md`. For Q-01 to Q-23, option A is the ontology's provisional answer. Q-24 to Q-31 have no provisional answer. `open_questions.md` names a most reasonable assumption for some of them.
