-- Aliases: OBS-H6 (renamed), V11, C1, C3, C4R (phases and package), B1-C44K, B1-C44T, B1-C45K, B1-C45T, B1-C46K, B1-C47K, B1-C47T, B1-C48K, B1-C49K (top-record fields).
